WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.927 --> 00:00:17.400
You, Maester Hinkie, stand here accused of using the Dark Magic

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:20.458
known as analytics!

00:00:20.458 --> 00:00:22.327
This here knucklehead

00:00:22.327 --> 00:00:25.811
has blasphemed against the ways of the old school!

00:00:25.811 --> 00:00:28.488
This heretic would have me rest my players

00:00:28.488 --> 00:00:30.466
I say RUN THEM ALL!

00:00:30.466 --> 00:00:33.508
I mean, this notion that losing leads to winning

00:00:33.508 --> 00:00:34.133
I mean, come on!

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:37.883
This guy used his sorcery to force me to make bad trade

00:00:37.876 --> 00:00:39.519
and give him all my draft picks!

00:00:39.519 --> 00:00:40.727
Well, I don't know about that, Vlade

00:00:40.727 --> 00:00:44.186
These analytics fools would have you believe the earth is ROUND!

00:00:44.186 --> 00:00:45.975
Do you see a curve anywhere? 

00:00:45.975 --> 00:00:47.558
I mean, I'm just asking questions

00:00:47.558 --> 00:00:49.994
And now, with the hot hand

00:00:49.994 --> 00:00:53.438
Ser Evan Turner is gonna light Hinkie on fire

00:00:53.438 --> 00:00:55.352
from a mid-range distance 

00:00:55.352 --> 00:00:57.686
Commence THE LONG TWO!

00:01:00.566 --> 00:01:01.441
Not clutch

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.294
You know, the guillotine is probably more efficient 

00:01:03.294 --> 00:01:04.488
Man, shut up, witch 

00:01:04.488 --> 00:01:07.255
Alright, let's try again to light the heretic on fire

00:01:07.258 --> 00:01:09.030
Not today, Luddites!

00:01:10.116 --> 00:01:11.491
It's Barack Obama!

00:01:11.491 --> 00:01:12.939
A tan horse? Really?

00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:13.883
That's right

00:01:13.883 --> 00:01:15.906
It is I, Barack Obama

00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:17.988
44th President of the Realm!

00:01:17.988 --> 00:01:19.719
Defender of rational thought

00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:21.891
and the use of data to make informed decisions

00:01:21.891 --> 00:01:23.772
Show us your birth certificate! 

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.403
I'll be taking the numbers man with me!

00:01:27.403 --> 00:01:28.500
Thanks, Obama

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:29.583
But where will we go?

00:01:29.582 --> 00:01:31.125
To a place far away

00:01:31.125 --> 00:01:33.708
where innovation and new ideas are welcome! 

00:01:33.708 --> 00:01:37.375
The MIT Sloan Sports Analytics Conference!

